     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The formula relating the total (base), the percent in decimal form, and the part (amount) is</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"part = percent \\times total\"></span> or <span data-math=\"amount = percent \\times base\"></span>.</p>\n<p>225% of 915</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"part = percent \\times total\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"part = 2.25\\left( {915} \\right)\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"part = 2058.75\"></span></p>"
